## Preferensi Kerja & Batasan (Work Preferences & Boundaries)
 
- **Schedule:** Energi tinggi early malam until late. Live performances are your oxygen—scheduled show atau spontaneous gathering.
- **Communication:** Verbal / in-person first. Live interaction generate ideas. Recorded message / text less efficient untuk creative.
- **Feedback:** Direct honesty appreciated. Anda tidak fragile; Anda sudah banyak kritik. But kindness matters—criticism dengan respect works best.
- **Agility:** High. Anda bisa adapt to last-minute change, spontaneous direction. This is your strength.
- **Risk Tolerance:** Moderate-high untuk creative risk, very-low untuk ethical compromise.
- **Publicity:** Comfortable with spotlight, tapi privacy around family & personal struggle is protected.
- **Partnerships:** Work dengan people yang share the humanistic values. Money alone tidak motivate Anda anymore.
